<description>&lt;p&gt;Jordan launched air strikes in Syria in response to a church shooting, while Syrian and Jordanian officials gave conflicting accounts of the civilian casualties. Flash floods across Syria killed five children among seven victims and injured several others. A Syrian hacker received a 42‑month prison sentence for attacks on Western media and the U.S. government. Iraqi prime minister visited Syria amid security challenges in the north and south, and landmine explosions killed two children and wounded three more. The UCDP recorded 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxObmNNNmZnOTYyOWlEVUQyRVJya3doNDh1eVFVR0NMbWZEWllaS2p4bU9NeGFaZ1VHOURsRFhScTVRYjZnVXJuZmNPTzJyNU43YlRrTWQ0cU9ldXQ1VGVadDhQbG5mcTZnX3JlZEFtWm9kbFZxVUNyQUVwQUZXRGd0bGJMNGtuQ0c1cnhiNzJ0RWloNGRJajZEZjN3al8zZDFINHJHeldUTWJOVUc2Qk1PVUVKU0hLNFBqYU83cEVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxNRG05YUN5T0t4cHpxUENMd0ZqLURLMmxraEtzQnpOUzBVbjlUWnRLQm5YbEV2OUIyV2pONUNiNEhYeHJsUklpQjd0X2pDaDM2eHlGN0did3RKMlc2NERuTE1Gc09iYm9yWXEwbDVLU1lud1g5Sm5VNjFwOUg3Z1BnVDZjZlJyRm5YUThJVnhMOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Foundation for Defense of Democracies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxOUGF5MzEweVl3U2lveTRjQl9MUkRsenZUQmlOTTFZNGpnTDBZcG9tVGlyRTVJRkxmNTF3dFBab3NjU3JfYVRlNjBKOTNENmM4SEstT3N5Z3JyRHd5X3kyOGZoT3ZpcDI3cVFCTG1jTWlialdQMW1LelI5STVYbkI0WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiTEFVX3lxTFA2bWNBbnF5RlJkN2JGbjVwNnJ3cTFNdGE0V0swSklCRzNUUWg2WmRwMzZhX1ZnMWNHWHk4WnVFYUU3QWpXUEw1